        "heading": "Our Story",
        "body_text": "<p>At <strong>First Room Collective</strong>, we believe walls are more than surfaces. They are an opportunity to create something extraordinary. <br/>Born from a passion for thoughtful interiors, we curate premium wallpapers that transform everyday spaces into timeless experiences. <br/><br/>We believe every design carries a story—and every story begins with you. The way you live, dream, and express yourself becomes the starting point of our creative process. Through thoughtful craftsmanship and meaningful detail, we translate these emotions into pieces that feel personal, timeless, and deeply connected to the spaces you call home.</p>",
